# Use case backlog

Use cases a split left for later, in dependency order. **No number reserved** — a number
is given when the case is designed. Remove the line when its `/new-feature` starts.

| Depends on | Description for `/new-feature` | Split from |
|---|---|---|
| `UC-001-create-customer` | REST endpoint that reads one customer by id from the `customers` table. Not found is a business error | `UC-001-create-customer` |
| `UC-001-create-customer` | REST endpoint that renames a customer in the `customers` table. Name must stay unique | `UC-001-create-customer` |
| `UC-001-create-customer` | REST endpoint that deletes a customer by id from the `customers` table | `UC-001-create-customer` |

